**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Food Delivery**

| **Name** | **Text** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Relation** |
|----------|-----------|--------------|---------------|--------------|
| **G1 Deliver Food** | Deliver food from kitchen to inpatient room | `;` (sequential) | Perform | AND: G2, G3, G4, G5 |
| **G2 Get Delivery Request** | Retrieve delivery request from kitchen system | `-` | Query | – |
| **G3 Retrieve Meal from Kitchen** | Retrieve meal from kitchen | `;` (sequential) | Perform | AND: AT2, AT3, AT4 |
| **G4 Deliver Meal to Inpatient Room** | Deliver meal to inpatient room | `;` (sequential) | Perform | AND: G4.1, G4.2 |
| **G4.1 Open Door** | Open the room door | `-` | Perform | – |
| **G4.2 Deliver Meal** | Deliver meal to table or tray | `FALLBACK(AT6, AT13)` | Perform | OR: AT6, AT13 |
| **G5 Dish Retrieval** | Retrieve dishes from room | `;` (sequential) | Perform | AND: G5.1, G5.2 |
| **G5.1 Meal Retrieval** | Handle meal‑retrieval tasks | `;` (sequential) | Perform | AND: AT8, AT9, AT10 |
| **G5.2 Dish Retrieval** | Retrieve dirty dishes | `;` (sequential) | Perform | AND: AT11, AT12 |

