### Task Model

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** |
|----------|-----------|--------------|--------------|-----------------------|
| **AT1 Receive Order** | Receive order from kitchen system | – | kitchen | 1 |
| **AT2 Go to Kitchen** | Navigate to kitchen | – | kitchen | 1 |
| **AT3 Pick up Meal** | Pick up meal | – | kitchen | 1 |
| **AT4 Load onto Tray** | Load meal onto robot tray | – | kitchen | 1 |
| **AT5 Open Room Door** | Open the room door | – | room door | [1,2] |
| **AT6 Deliver to Table** | Deliver meal to room table | – | room table | 1 |
