| **AT8 Indicate Meal to Patient** | Indicate which meal should be retrieved | – | room | 1 |
| **AT9 Record Retrieval Time/Location** | Record time and location of meal retrieval | – | robot | 1 |
| **AT10 Alert Wrong Meal** | Alert if wrong meal is retrieved | – | robot | 1 |
| **AT11 Identify Dirty Dishes** | Identify dirty dishes in room | – | room | 1 |
| **AT12 Retrieve Dishes** | Retrieve dirty dishes | – | room | [1,2] |

